Your dog has done plenty of fighting for you.  I've never gotten very
far in nethack, but right now I do have an 8th level healer on dlevel 3.
My pet cat currently maxes at 120 HP.  It seems that your pet's maxHP
goes up every time it kills something; I believe the amount it goes up
is related to the level of the monster it kills.  So, in fact, your
dog has been doing quite a bit of fighting.

I've also noticed that the pet's level goes up every 8 HP, until it
reaches level 6.  Beyond that would probably be relatively meaningless.
(Could you picture your dog being level 44?)  Besides, noting the change
in name from "little dog" to "dog" to "large dog", the designers
probably didn't feel like storing 50-odd names for pet dogs.  They
probably didn't want you to get more XP for killing your pet than, say,
Beelzebub.

Anyway, trust me.  Your pet has been doing a lot of the dirty work.
